{"3898050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dead by Headshot", "steam_appid": 3898050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead by Headshot</strong> is a first-person survival horror shooter with apocalyptic simulation elements, focused on precision aiming and brutal headshot mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>⚠️ <strong>Warning: This video game may potentially trigger seizures for people with photosensitive epilepsy. Player discretion is advised.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a lone survivor trapped in a once-peaceful suburban home as civilization collapses outside. A global pandemic has unleashed hordes of ravenous, zombie-like creatures. In pitch-black darkness, illuminated only by your flickering flashlight, you must fight to survive until dawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898050/extras/5d77fe4d51a1f23a305e2f37b43aa444.poster.avif?t=1761842851\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898050/extras/5d77fe4d51a1f23a305e2f37b43aa444.webm?t=1761842851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898050/extras/5d77fe4d51a1f23a305e2f37b43aa444.mp4?t=1761842851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hand-crafted environments filled with oppressive tension and terrifying atmosphere. Every creaking floorboard, every shadow hides something that wants you dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898050/extras/0cb6e5c9da1e987a63705bba394c53c7.poster.avif?t=1761842851\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898050/extras/0cb6e5c9da1e987a63705bba394c53c7.webm?t=1761842851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898050/extras/0cb6e5c9da1e987a63705bba394c53c7.mp4?t=1761842851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with nothing but a revolver, you must manage your ammunition with precision. Each passing hour brings greater danger: the infected become faster, more aggressive, and harder to kill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898050/extras/b0c1fafbe816ee37c7491ee835f933e4.poster.avif?t=1761842851\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898050/extras/b0c1fafbe816ee37c7491ee835f933e4.webm?t=1761842851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898050/extras/b0c1fafbe816ee37c7491ee835f933e4.mp4?t=1761842851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worse yet, they can only be stopped with perfect headshots – demanding ice-cold nerves, pinpoint accuracy, and smart resource management to survive the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898050/extras/e2de3e9ef5ea224fc69e1aa4de689cc7.poster.avif?t=1761842851\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898050/extras/e2de3e9ef5ea224fc69e1aa4de689cc7.webm?t=1761842851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898050/extras/e2de3e9ef5ea224fc69e1aa4de689cc7.mp4?t=1761842851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you live to see the morning, or join the countless others consumed by the infection?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead by Headshot</strong> is a first-person survival horror shooter with apocalyptic simulation elements, focused on precision aiming and brutal headshot mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>⚠️ <strong>Warning: This video game may potentially trigger seizures for people with photosensitive epilepsy. Player discretion is advised.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a lone survivor trapped in a once-peaceful suburban home as civilization collapses outside. A global pandemic has unleashed hordes of ravenous, zombie-like creatures. In pitch-black darkness, illuminated only by your flickering flashlight, you must fight to survive until dawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898050/extras/5d77fe4d51a1f23a305e2f37b43aa444.poster.avif?t=1761842851\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898050/extras/5d77fe4d51a1f23a305e2f37b43aa444.webm?t=1761842851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898050/extras/5d77fe4d51a1f23a305e2f37b43aa444.mp4?t=1761842851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hand-crafted environments filled with oppressive tension and terrifying atmosphere. Every creaking floorboard, every shadow hides something that wants you dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898050/extras/0cb6e5c9da1e987a63705bba394c53c7.poster.avif?t=1761842851\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898050/extras/0cb6e5c9da1e987a63705bba394c53c7.webm?t=1761842851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898050/extras/0cb6e5c9da1e987a63705bba394c53c7.mp4?t=1761842851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with nothing but a revolver, you must manage your ammunition with precision. Each passing hour brings greater danger: the infected become faster, more aggressive, and harder to kill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898050/extras/b0c1fafbe816ee37c7491ee835f933e4.poster.avif?t=1761842851\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898050/extras/b0c1fafbe816ee37c7491ee835f933e4.webm?t=1761842851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898050/extras/b0c1fafbe816ee37c7491ee835f933e4.mp4?t=1761842851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Worse yet, they can only be stopped with perfect headshots – demanding ice-cold nerves, pinpoint accuracy, and smart resource management to survive the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898050/extras/e2de3e9ef5ea224fc69e1aa4de689cc7.poster.avif?t=1761842851\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898050/extras/e2de3e9ef5ea224fc69e1aa4de689cc7.webm?t=1761842851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sou